<title>LATVIA: STABURADZE LOSES GROUND, CHIPS MIXED TO LOWER.</title>
<headline>STABURADZE LOSES GROUND, CHIPS MIXED TO LOWER.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Staburadze confectionary lost</p>
<p>ground and other blue chips were mixed to lower on Tuesday at</p>
<p>the morning price fix.</p>
<p>Lode Brick maker continued edging up after an improved</p>
<p>half-year result forecast last week.</p>
